        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Aram Duithanzaeng kao mei hei ,",
            "1956 Khou lung thao e,",
            "Poupei kinc khou muh aramv hei ,",
            "Khouring khou-nah kailuang sw khuan ne.",
            "",
            "Nzianne aramv mei naah thiu,",
            "Ai ningbam mei guang dat khang ,",
            "Zian ne zian ne arupmei ,",
            "Ziangri guang salam sudat ngam mak.",
            "",
            "2. Charin ne raguang ram dam hei ,",
            "Kagui gai e aram Duithanzeang,",
            "Ravguangc rui suaihiam lou pui ram",
            "Tingsaeng nga thuan diu Ravguangc zan ta.",
            "",
            "3. Nampaanc thang rui phaeng guang zau ki,",
            "Gailiang e aram hei namluang khou",
            "Munbang ching ching rui thao padik",
            "Mun rimv rui kaphanc su aramv ta.",
            "",
            "4. Chabuanc kin azu guay rui na.",
            "Neihlaa tarina lung bam khuan ne,",
            "Meikin azuh lungthao pui ramv",
            "Nchu nzaeng na lung bam khuan ne."
          ]
        }
      }
